External data used by tests and database import
-----------------------------------------------

Some reduced fixtures under tests/data/db/ are derived from the upstream
IDS/IWDS data used by ids4c. The directory is not a complete copy of either
upstream repository and also contains project-specific test cases.

1. YiBai IDS data

   Source: https://github.com/yi-bai/ids
   Copyright (c) 2021 Yi Bai.
   License: MIT License.

   The original IDS repository requires its copyright notice and permission
   notice to be retained in copies or substantial portions of the data. The
   complete upstream license is available in that repository's LICENSE file.

2. IWDS data

   Source: https://github.com/yi-bai/iwds
   Project: IRG Working Document Standards.

   This repository attributes the upstream source, but does not grant a
   license to redistribute the complete IWDS repository or its data. The
   current upstream repository should be checked for applicable copyright,
