   The upstream documentation is released under the MIT License. It is
   referenced by ids4c but is not vendored into this repository.

Build-time dependencies
-----------------------

Boost, GTKmm/GTK, pybind11, and SQLite are normally supplied by the build
environment and are not vendored in this repository. Their own license and
attribution requirements apply if a binary distribution bundles them.
